      "content": "This sense of being trapped by obligation is a severe form of emotional exhaustion known as burnout, not a temporary phase, and recognizing this pain is the first step toward healing. While stopping all responsibilities isn't always possible, therapy can help you establish boundaries and identify actions where your authentic self is prioritized over others' expectations. Please reach out to a mental health professional immediately to process these feelings safely, as finding relief from this specific kind of internal weight is achievable. You are capable of creating a life that belongs only to you, even if that journey feels impossible right now.",
